name: sim.alphaBetaGammaToYawPitchRoll
description: Deprecated. Use sim.abgToYpr instead
luaSynopsis: float yaw, float pitch, float roll = sim.alphaBetaGammaToYawPitchRoll(float alpha, float beta, float gamma)
pythonSynopsis: float yaw, float pitch, float roll = sim.alphaBetaGammaToYawPitchRoll(float alpha, float beta, float gamma)
inputs:
1. alpha: the alpha angle
2. beta: the beta angle
3. gamma: the gamma angle
outputs:
1. yaw: the yaw angle
2. pitch: the pitch angle
3. roll: the roll angle
